~ post_photo_best

Red: ................

Red: [shake rate=20.0 level=5 connected=1] I LOVE IT!!!! [/shake]

Red: [font_size=10] sorry I didn’t mean to be so loud [/font_size]

Red: It’s just that I’ve been feeling more and more like the world is getting to be a harder place to live in.

Red: Like no matter what I or anyone does, the people in charge are just going to keep stepping on us to fight for the top.

Red: And it sucks. So I hid.

Red: I just stayed in my room and closed myself into worlds I could save.

Red: But I’ve been feeling lately like I want to make a change. I’m done being small and I’m done hiding.

Red: And this outfit makes me feel brave! These pictures look like someone who can DO something!

Red: Thank you!
=> END

